sequenceDiagram
    participant OpMode as L135Choose<br/>AutoOpMode
    participant DS as L135Driver<br/>StationMenu
    participant Buttons as L135Menu<br/>Buttons
    participant Menu as L135Option<br/>Menu
    participant Row as L135Menu<br/>Row
    OpMode->>DS: loop(gamepad1),<br/>from init_loop()
    DS->>Buttons: loop(gamepad)
    Buttons->>Menu: right()
    Menu->>Row: right()
    DS->>Menu: lines()
    Menu->>Row: line()
    Row-->>Menu: "Alliance: Blue? A:OK B:Back"
    Menu-->>DS: the summary and each row's line
    DS->>DS: printToDs,<br/>for each line
